Package: camx-kodiak-ppa-config
Architecture: any
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         camx-kodiak (= ${binary:Version}),
         libqmmf-server-lib,
Description: Ubuntu PPA camera service integration for Qualcomm Kodiak
 Compatibility library links and systemd configuration for using the
 Ubuntu hardware ISP PPA camera service with the Qualcomm Kodiak CamX
 and CHI/CDK runtime. Selects the Kodiak QMMF and camera HAL libraries
 for cam-server.
 Camera services, drivers, CHI/CDK components, platform firmware and sensor
 data must be installed separately.

